          "snippet": {
            "line": 300,
            "text": "theorem lower_comparison_preserves {X a L b q : ℝ}\n    (ha : 0 < a) (haX : a ≤ X) (hL : 0 < L) (hq : 0 ≤ q) (hqa : b * L ≤ q * a) :\n    b ≤ b * a / X + q / (2 * L) * (X - a ^ 2 / X)"
